abstract: "Replication code and derived datasets for the paper testing whether matrilineal Minangkabau and patrilineal Bataknese households in Indonesia configure translocal migration into distinct strategy types, using the Indonesian Family Life Survey wave 5 (IFLS-5, 2014; n = 6,936 ethnic-modal households)."
